sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor Operator
    participant UI as POS UI
    participant Ops as Refund or Reversal Use Case
    participant Repo as Transaction Repository
    participant Processor as Mock Processor

    Operator->>UI: Select original transaction
    UI->>Ops: Request refund or reversal with a distinct idempotency key
    Ops->>Repo: Load original transaction and operation history
    Repo-->>Ops: Return original status and prior operations
    Ops->>Ops: Validate operation-specific preconditions
    alt Invalid state or duplicate operation
        Ops-->>UI: Reject request with safe reason
    else Valid request
        Ops->>Repo: Persist pending operation linked to original
        Ops->>Processor: Submit synthetic refund or reversal
        alt Definitive response received
            Processor-->>Ops: Simulated approval or decline
            Ops->>Repo: Persist final operation state
            Ops-->>UI: Display result and safe reference
        else Timeout or unknown response
            Processor--xOps: Outcome cannot be confirmed
            Ops->>Repo: Persist UNKNOWN_OUTCOME and reconciliation-required flag
            Ops-->>UI: Show pending confirmation; do not create a new operation
        end
    end
